  "releaseNotes": "2.9.1 - Same engine as Cocos2D-Mono 2.9.1: CCLabel works on Linux and macOS desktop again. No API changes.\n2.9.0 - Same engine as Cocos2D-Mono 2.9.0: the last nullable reference type annotations, fixes found while converting, and zlib through System.IO.Compression, with the bundled zlib port now obsolete. Read the CHANGELOG's Upgrading notes before updating.\n- See https://github.com/Cocos2D-Mono/cocos2d-mono for the full changelog.",
